  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Short on movement methods for large fights, Fang Yuan starts from rank one clear wind wheel Gu and rank two jade wind wheel Gu, builds a wind-path move that forms cyclone wheels under both feet, then adds fire-path Immortal Gu for burst potential. He casually names it fire-wind wheel. The killer move has burst speed and can become increasingly faster while consuming little immortal essence and needing little mental control. It is a rank seven killer move at a level that tramples at least seventy percent of existing killer moves for him, but wind-fire dao mark friction would drop practical results to about rank six for ordinary Gu Immortals.",
